wonderful lyrics to this melody. And I wish to broadcast this song to the universe so that we can

01:21:46.140 --> 01:21:59.860
negotiate for peace with the Meltrandi and establish a warless, peaceful world. We can take this first

01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:04.340
